@ohdsi-mcps/omop-cdm
====================

This package bundles table- and field-level CSV definitions of the OMOP Common
Data Model versions 5.3, 5.4, and 6.0, sourced from the OHDSI CommonDataModel
repository:

  https://github.com/OHDSI/CommonDataModel

Upstream license: Apache-2.0 (see vendor/CommonDataModel/DESCRIPTION).
The specific snapshot used is pinned via the git submodule at
`vendor/CommonDataModel`. The commit hash of that snapshot is exported as
`SOURCE_COMMIT` from `src/generated/content.ts`, which is regenerated by
`npm run generate-content`.
